7:53:52 AM [express] POST /api/generate-review 200 in 3918ms :: {"review":"Our stay at the Aster Inn was absolutely wonderful, and a huge part of that was the fantastic food. Seriously, every dish we tried, from breakfast spreads to the evening meals, was delicious and clearly made with care. It wasn't just sustenance; it was a genuine dining experience. We were so impressed with the quality and variety. It really made our trip memorable!"}
