8:22:49 AM [express] POST /api/generate-review 200 in 4484ms :: {"review":"My recent stay at the Aster Inn was quite pleasant. The room was really clean and the bed was comfortable, which is always a plus. Everything in the room felt well-kept and functional. It wasn't completely perfect, but for the price and what I needed, it definitely hit the mark. I'd give it a solid four stars for a dependable stay."}
